{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/Store1.png?t=1744954763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a contractor hired to perform routine maintenance in an abandoned hospital. What was supposed to be a simple job quickly turns into a desperate fight for survival. As you navigate the dark hallways, restoring power and unlocking doors, you uncover disturbing secrets hidden within the facility and its mysterious operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/Store2.png?t=1744954763\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich lore:</strong> Stories unfold through files, computer logs, old notes, and environmental storytelling, helping the player piece together this sinister mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Frightening combat:</strong> The player is trapped inside a building with dangerous criminals who will eliminate anyone that threatens their operation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive graphics and soundscape</strong>:\u00a0Carefully crafted to imerse you in this dark abandoned environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/Store3.png?t=1744954763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614960?t=1744954763","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/bcd17885a4f0096db7a4b9011c87156f7411165f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744954763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/3526bb3043ed2dc108f359a2e30a6f09ea0567ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=174